<title>SWEDEN: FORECAST-Swedbank issues new Swedish estimates.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Swedbank issues new Swedish estimates.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bank Swedbank's latest economic forecasts for Sweden, released on Tuesday, with changes in percent unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>					    1997	1998</p>
<p> Gross Domestic Product		2.7	 3.3</p>
<p> Private consumption		   2.0	 2.7</p>
<p> Public consumption		    0.1	 0.1</p>
<p> Export				    7.0	 6.9</p>
<p> Import				    4.8	 6.2</p>
<p> Consumer Price Index		  0.8	 2.0</p>
<p> Industrial production		 5.5	 6.2</p>
<p> Unemployment			    8.2	 7.7</p>
<p> Current account (Bln SKR)	    52	  67</p>
<p> Trade balance (Bln SKR)	     134	 152</p>
<p> State's net lending (Bln SKR)	 1	 -10</p>
<p> Consolidated state debt</p>
<p>  (pct GDP)			     74.0	69.4</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
